      "headline": "The song appears on the album \"Human After All\" (2005)",
      "supportingCopy": "The song appears on the album \"Human After All\" (2005). \"Technologic\" is a song by the French duo Daft Punk from their third studio album, Human After All (2005). Human After All is the third studio album by the French electronic music duo Daft Punk, released on 14 March 2005 through Virgin Records. Whereas their previous studio album, Discovery (2001), was inspired by disco and garage house and produced over two years, Human After All was more minimalistic and improvisational with heavier guitars and electronics, and was produced in six weeks. Artist: Daft Punk · Title: Technologic · Album: Technologic · Year: 2005 · Genre: House · Path: MEDIA/VIDEO/2000's/Daft Punk - Random Access Memories is the fourth and final studio album by the French electronic music duo Daft Punk. The album pays tribute to late 1970s and early 1980s American music, particularly from Los Angeles.",
